; SIGNATURE PROBE at (-> Str Str Bool). This one is kept because it FAILS to
; discriminate, and that failure is the measurement: two of the operations this
; consumer reuses — the lexicographic order it sorts by, and the prefix test one
; of lib.oath's laws is written with — have the SAME signature, and so do
; several definitions that are neither. A shape query cannot separate them. Two
; different need-*.oath files at this one shape are what does.
(defn wanted [] [(a Str) (b Str)] Bool
  true)
